#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:886
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This is the default format and Tables autodetects the actual data type "
#| "depending on the current cell data. By default, Tables right justifies "
#| "numbers, dates and times within a cell and left justifies anything else."
msgid ""
"This is the default format and Calligra Sheets autodetects the actual data "
"type depending on the current cell data. By default, Calligra Sheets right "
"justifies numbers, dates and times within a cell and left justifies anything "
"else."
msgstr ""
"Dit is dat Standardformaat. De aktuell Datentyp warrt mit Hülp vun de "
"aktuellen Zelldaten automaatsch rutfunnen. Standardwies warrt Tallen, Datum- "
"un Tietangaven binnen en Zell rechterhand utricht, un all anner Indrääg "
"links."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:890
msgid ""
"The number notation uses the notation you globally choose in System Settings "
"-> Common Appearance and Behavior -> Locale -> Country/Region & Language -> "
"Numbers tab. Numbers are right justified by default."
msgstr ""
"De Schriefwies vun Tallen bruukt de systeemwiet fastleggten Instellen ut "
"\"Systeminstellen\" -> \"Allgemeen Arbeitrebeet-Utsehn un -Bedregen\" -> "
"\"Spraakinstellen\" -> \"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" -> \"Tallen\". "
"Standardwies warrt Tallen rechterhand utricht."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:894
msgid ""
"When you have a number in the current cell and you switch from the dcell "
"format from Generic to Percent, the current cell number will be multiplied "
"by 100%.\n"
"For example if you enter 12 and set the cell format to Percent, the number "
"will then be 1,200 %. Switching back to Generic cell format will bring it "
"back to 12.\n"
"You can also use the Percent icon in the Format Toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Bargt de aktuell Zell en Tall un Een wesselt vun dat Zellformaat \"Allgemeen"
"\" na \"Perzent\", warrt de aktuell Tall mit 100% maalnahmen.\n"
"Giffst Du a.B. \"12\" in un wesselst dorna dat Zellformaat na Perzent, warrt "
"de Tall na \"1200%\" wannelt. Geihst Du wedder na't allgemeen Zellformaat "
"torüch, warrt se wedder na \"12\" wannelt.\n"
"Du kannst dor ok dat Perzent-Lüttbild ut den Formaat-Warktüüchbalken för "
"bruken."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:898
msgid ""
"The Money format converts your number into money notation using the settings "
"globally fixed in System Settings -> Common Appearance and Behavior -> "
"Locale -> Country/Region & Language -> Money. The currency symbol will be "
"displayed and the precision will be the one set in System Settings.\n"
"You can also use the Currency icon in the Format Toolbar to set the cell "
"formatting to look like your current currency."
msgstr ""
"Dat Geldformaat wannelt Dien Tall na de Geldschriefwies üm. Dor warrt de "
"systemwieden Instellen ut \"Systeminstellen\" -> \"Allgemeen Arbeitrebeet-"
"Utsehn un -Bedregen\" -> \"Spraakinstellen\" -> \"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" -"
"> \"Geld\" för bruukt. Dat Geldsymbool warrt wiest un de Nauigkeit bruukt, "
"de in't Systeminstellen fastleggt is.\n"
"Een kann för't Topassen ok dat Geldsymbool ut den Formaat-Warktüüchbalken "
"bruken, dormit dat Zellformaat liek Dien aktuell Geldsort lett."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:901
msgid "Scientific"
msgstr "Wetenschaplich"

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:902
msgid ""
"The scientific format changes your number using the scientific notation. For "
"example, 0.0012 will be changed to 1.2E-03. Going back using Generic cell "
"format will display 0.0012 again."
msgstr ""
"Dat wetenschaplich Formaat ännert de Tall na de wetenschaplich Schriefwies, "
"a.B. 1,2E-03 ansteed vun 0,0012. Torüch na't Standard-Zellenformaat warrt "
"wedder 0,0012 wiest."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:906
msgid ""
"The fraction format changes your number into a fraction. For example, 0.1 "
"can be changed to 1/8, 2/16, 1/10, etc. You define the type of fraction by "
"choosing it in the field on the right. If the exact fraction is not possible "
"in the fraction mode you choose, the nearest closest match is chosen.\n"
" For example: when we have 1.5 as number, we choose Fraction and Sixteenths "
"1/16 the text displayed into cell is \"1 8/16\" which is an exact fraction. "
"If you have 1.4 as number in your cell and you choose Fraction and "
"Sixteenths 1/16 then the cell will display \"1 6/16\" which is the nearest "
"closest Sixteenth fraction."
msgstr ""
"Dat Brook-Formaat ännert de Tall na en Brook. So lett sik a.B. 0,1 na 1/8, "
"2/16, 1/10 usw. ännern. In't Feld rechterhand warrt de Brooktyp fastleggt. "
"Wenn de Brook mit den utsöchten Typ nich nau mööglich is, warrt de dichtst "
"bi leggen bruukt.\n"
"För a.B. 1,5 as Tall un wenn Brook un Sössteihndel 1/16 utsöcht is, warrt in "
"de Zell \"1 8/16\" wiest, wat en nau Brook is. För 1,4 as Tall un wenn Brook "
"un Sössteihndel 1/16 utsöcht is, warrt \"1 6/16\" wiest, wat de dichtst bi "
"liggen Sössteihndel-Brook is."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:910
msgid ""
"To enter a date, you should enter it in one of the formats set in System "
"Settings -> Common Appearance and Behavior -> Locale -> Country/Region & "
"Language -> Time & Dates. There are two formats set here: the date format "
"and the short date format.\n"
"Just like you can drag down numbers you can also drag down dates and the "
"next cells will also get dates."
msgstr ""
"En Datum schall in een vun de twee Tietformaten ingeven warrn, de in de "
"Systeminstellen bi \"Allgemeen Arbeitrebeet-Utsehn un -Bedregen\" -> "
"\"Spraakinstellen\" -> \"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" -> \"Tiet un Datum\" "
"fastleggt sünd. Hier laat sik twee Formaten instellen: Dat Datumformaat un "
"dat Datumkortformaat.\n"
"Datumangaven laat sik op de sülve Oort daaltrecken as Tallen. De nakamen "
"Zellen bargt denn ok Datumangaven."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:914
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This formats your cell content as a time. To enter a time, you should "
#| "enter it in the Time format set in System Settings -> Common Appearance "
#| "and Behavior -> Locale -> Country/Region & Language -> Date & Time. In "
#| "the Cell Format dialog box you can set how the time should be displayed "
#| "by choosing one of the available time format options. The default format "
#| "is the system format set in System Settings. When the number in the cell "
#| "does not make sense as a time, Tables will display 00:00 in the global "
#| "format you have in System Settings."
msgid ""
"This formats your cell content as a time. To enter a time, you should enter "
"it in the Time format set in System Settings -> Common Appearance and "
"Behavior -> Locale -> Country/Region & Language -> Date & Time. In the Cell "
"Format dialog box you can set how the time should be displayed by choosing "
"one of the available time format options. The default format is the system "
"format set in System Settings. When the number in the cell does not make "
"sense as a time, Calligra Sheets will display 00:00 in the global format you "
"have in System Settings."
msgstr ""
"Dit formateert den Zellinholt as Tiet. En Tiet schall in dat Formaat ingeven "
"warrn, dat in de Systeminstellen bi \"Allgemeen Arbeitrebeet-Utsehn un -"
"Bedregen\" -> \"Spraakinstellen\" -> \"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" -> \"Tiet un "
"Datum\" fastleggt is.. In't Menü \"Zellenformaat\" lett sik ut verscheden "
"Formaten utsöken, wodennig de Tiet wiest warrt. Dat Standardformaat is dat "
"Systeemformaat, as in't Kuntrullzentrum fastleggt. Wenn de Tall binnen de "
"Zell sik nich as gellen Tietangaav bruken lett, warrt 00:00 in't globaal "
"Tietformaat wiest."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:918
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This formats your cell content as date and time. To enter a date and a "
#| "time, you should enter it in the Time format set in System Settings -> "
#| "Common Appearance and Behavior -> Locale -> Country/Region & Language -> "
#| "Time & Dates. In the Cell Format dialog box you can set how the time "
#| "should be displayed by choosing one of the available date format options. "
#| "The default format is the system format set in System Settings. When the "
#| "number in the cell does not make sense as a date and time, Tables will "
#| "display 00:00 in the global format you have in System Settings."
msgid ""
"This formats your cell content as date and time. To enter a date and a time, "
"you should enter it in the Time format set in System Settings -> Common "
"Appearance and Behavior -> Locale -> Country/Region & Language -> Time & "
"Dates. In the Cell Format dialog box you can set how the time should be "
"displayed by choosing one of the available date format options. The default "
"format is the system format set in System Settings. When the number in the "
"cell does not make sense as a date and time, Calligra Sheets will display "
"00:00 in the global format you have in System Settings."
msgstr ""
"Dit formateert den Zellinholt as Datum un Tiet. En Datum un en Tiet schall "
"in't Tietformaat ingeven warrn, dat in't Kuntrullzentrum bi \"Regioon un "
"Toganghülp\" -> \"Land/Regioon un Spraak\" -> \"Tiet un Datum\" instellt is. "
"In't Menü \"Zellenformaat\" lett sik ut verscheden Formaten utsöken, "
"wodennig dat Datum un de Tiet wiest warrt. Dat Standardformaat is dat "
"Systeemformaat, as in't Kuntrullzentrum fastleggt. Wenn de Tall binnen de "
"Zell sik nich as gellen Datum- oder Tietangaav bruken lett, warrt 00:00 in't "
"globaal Tietformaat wiest."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:922
msgid ""
"This formats your cell content as text. This can be useful if you want a "
"number treated as text instead as a number, for example for a ZIP code. "
"Setting a number as text format will left justify it. When numbers are "
"formatted as text, they cannot be used in calculations or formulas. It also "
"change the way the cell is justified."
msgstr ""
"Dit formateert den Zellinholt as Text. Dat kann wat bringen, wenn Een en "
"Tall as Text un nich as Tall behanneln will, a.B. en Postleddtall. En as "
"Text formateert Tall warrt linkerhand utricht. Wenn Tallen as Text "
"formateert warrt, laat se sik nich för't Utreken oder för Formeln bruken. "
"Dit ännert ok de Zellutrichten."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:925
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Egen"

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:926
msgid "The custom format does not work yet. To be enabled in the next release."
msgstr "Dat egen Formaat löppt noch nich. In en tokamen Utgaav villicht."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:935
msgid ""
"This will display a preview of your choice so you can know what it does "
"before clicking the OK button to validate it."
msgstr ""
"Dit wiest en Vöransicht vun Dien Köör, so dat Du de Ännern ankieken kannst, "
"ehr Du op \"OK\" klickst."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:946
msgid "Displays choices of format for the fraction, date or time formats."
msgstr "Wiest de Formaatköör för Bröök, Datum un Tiet."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:956
msgid ""
"You can add here a Postfix such as a $HK symbol to the end of each cell "
"content in the checked format."
msgstr ""
"Hier lett sik en Postfix liek a.B. en $HK-Symbool na elk Zellinholt in't "
"utsöcht Formaat tofögen."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:959
msgid "variable"
msgstr "Variable"

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:962
msgid ""
"You can control how many digits are displayed after the decimal point for "
"numeric values. This can also be changed using the Increase precision or "
"Decrease precision icons in the Format toolbar. "
msgstr ""
"Hier laat sik de Tall vun Nakommasteden för numeersch Weerten stüern. Dit "
"lett sik ok binnen den Formaat-Warktüüchbalken mit de Lüttbiller \"Höger "
"Nauigkeit\" oder \"Sieter Nauigkeit\" ännern. "

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:966
msgid ""
"You can add here a Prefix such as a $ symbol at the start of each cell "
"content in the checked format."
msgstr ""
"Hier lett sik en Prefix liek a.B. en $-Symbool vör elk Zellinholt in't "
"utsöcht Formaat tofögen."

#: dialogs/LayoutDialog.cpp:970
msgid ""
"You can choose whether positive values are displayed with a leading + sign "
"and whether negative values are shown in red."
msgstr ""
"Hier lett sik fastleggen, wat positiv Weerten en \"+\" vöranstellt warrt un "
"wat negativ Weerten root dorstellt warrt."

