msgid ""
"Returns the estimate of the standard deviation of a population based on a "
"sample using all numeric values in a column of a database specified by a set "
"of conditions."
msgstr ""
"Gifft en Populatschoon (statistisch Koppel) ehr vermoodt Standardverscheel "
"torüch, baseert op en Steekproov vun all numeersch Weerten ut en "
"Datenbankstriep na en angeven Sett vun Bedingen."

#: functions/database.xml:204
msgid "DSTDEV(Database; \"Header\"; Conditions)"
msgstr "DSTDEV(Datenbank; \"Överschrift\"; Bedingen)"

#: functions/database.xml:205
msgid "DSTDEV(A1:C5; \"Salary\"; A9:A11)"
msgstr "DSTDEV(A1:C5; \"Lohn\"; A9:A11)"

#: functions/database.xml:226
msgid ""
"Returns the standard deviation of a population based on the entire "
"population using all numeric values in a column of a database specified by a "
"set of conditions."
msgstr ""
"Gifft en Populatschoon (statistisch Koppel) ehr vermoodt Standardverscheel "
"torüch, baseert op de heel Koppel un all numeersch Weerten ut en "
"Datenbankstriep na en angeven Sett vun Bedingen."

#: functions/database.xml:227
msgid "DSTDEVP(Database; \"Header\"; Conditions)"
msgstr "DSTDEVP(Datenbank; \"Överschrift\"; Bedingen)"

#: functions/database.xml:228
msgid "DSTDEVP(A1:C5; \"Salary\"; A9:A11)"
msgstr "DSTDEVP(A1:C5; \"Lohn\"; A9:A11)"

#: functions/database.xml:249
msgid ""
"Returns the estimate of the variance of a population based on a sample using "
"all numeric values in a column of a database specified by a set of "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"Gifft en Populatschoon (statistisch Koppel) ehr vermoodt Varianz torüch, "
"baseert op en Steekproov vun all numeersch Weerten ut en Datenbankstriep na "
"en angeven Sett vun Bedingen."

#: functions/database.xml:250
msgid "DVAR(Database; \"Header\"; Conditions)"
msgstr "DVAR(Datenbank; \"Överschrift\"; Bedingen)"

#: functions/database.xml:251
msgid "DVAR(A1:C5; \"Salary\"; A9:A11)"
msgstr "DVAR(A1:C5; \"Lohn\"; A9:A11)"

#: functions/database.xml:272
msgid ""
"Returns the variance of a population based on the entire population using "
"all numeric values in a column of a database specified by a set of "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"Gifft en Populatschoon (statistisch Koppel) ehr vermoodt Varianz torüch, "
"baseert op de heel Koppel un all numeersch Weerten ut en Datenbankstriep na "
"en angeven Sett vun Bedingen."

#: functions/database.xml:273
msgid "DVARP(Database; \"Header\"; Conditions)"
msgstr "DVARP(Datenbank; \"Överschrift\"; Bedingen)"

#: functions/database.xml:274
msgid "DVARP(A1:C5; \"Salary\"; A9:A11)"
msgstr "DVARP(A1:C5; \"Lohn\"; A9:A11)"

#: functions/database.xml:284
msgid "Range containing the pivot table"
msgstr "Rebeet, dat de Pivot-Tabell bargt"

#: functions/database.xml:288
msgid "Name of the field of which you want the summary data"
msgstr "De Naam vun't Feld, ut dat de tosamenfaat Daten haalt warrn schöölt"

#: functions/database.xml:291
msgid "Fetches summary data from a pivot table."
msgstr "Haalt tosamenfaat Daten ut en Pivot-Tabell."

#: functions/database.xml:292
msgid "GETPIVOTDATA(Database; \"Sales\")"
msgstr "GETPIVOTDATA(Datenbank; \"Verkööp\")"

#: functions/datetime.xml:5
msgid "Date & Time"
msgstr "Datum un Tiet"

#: functions/datetime.xml:15 functions/datetime.xml:607
msgid "Method (optional)"
msgstr "Metood (optschonaal)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:19
msgid ""
"The WEEKDAY() function returns the weekday of given date. If the method is 1 "
"(default) WEEKDAY() returns 1 for sunday, 2 for monday,.. If the method is "
"2, monday is 1, tuesday 2, ... and if the method is 3 WEEKDAY() returns 0 "
"for monday, 1 for tuesday,..."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon WEEKDAY() gifft den Wekendag för en angeven Datum torüch. "
"Metood 1 (Standard) gifft för Sünndag \"1\" torüch, för Maandag \"2\", usw., "
"Metood 2 gifft för Maandag \"1\" torüch, för Dingsdag \"2\" usw., un Metood "
"3 gifft för Maandag \"0\" torüch, för Dingsdag \"1\", usw. ..."

#: functions/datetime.xml:20
msgid "WEEKDAY(date; method)"
msgstr "WEEKDAY(Datum; Utrekenmetood)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:21
msgid "WEEKDAY(\"2002-02-22\"; 2) returns 5"
msgstr "WEEKDAY(\"2002-02-22\"; 2) gifft \"5\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:30
msgid "Date1"
msgstr "Datum1"

#: functions/datetime.xml:34
msgid "Date2"
msgstr "Datum2"

#: functions/datetime.xml:38
msgid "Method"
msgstr "Metood"

#: functions/datetime.xml:42
msgid ""
"The DAYS360() function returns the number of days from date1 to date2 using "
"a 360-day calendar in which all months are assumed to have 30 days. If "
"method is false (default) the US method will be used, the European otherwise."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon DAYS360() gifft de Tall vun Daag vun Datum1 bet Datum2 torüch. "
"Bruukt warrt en Kalenner mit 360 Daag, un de Maanden warrt mit 30 Daag "
"vermoodt. Wenn de Metood \"falsch\" is (Standard), warrt de amerikaansch "
"Metood bruukt, anners de europääsch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:43
msgid "DAYS360(date1; date2; method)"
msgstr "DAYS360(Datum1; Datum2; Metood)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:44
msgid "DAYS360(\"2/22/2002\"; \"4/21/2002\"; FALSE) returns 59"
msgstr "DAYS360(\"2/22/2002\"; \"4/21/2002\"; falsch) gifft \"59\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:60
msgid ""
"The TIMEVALUE() function returns a number (between 0 and 1) representing the "
"time of day."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon TIMEVALUE() gifft en Tall (twischen 0 un 1) för de Daagtiet "
"torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:61
msgid "TIMEVALUE(time)"
msgstr "TIMEVALUE(Tiet)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:62
msgid "TIMEVALUE(\"10:05:02\") returns 0.42"
msgstr "TIMEVALUE(\"10:05:02\") gifft \"0.42\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:75
msgid ""
"The DATEVALUE function returns a number representing the day, i.e the number "
"of days elapsed since December 31, 1899."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon DATEVALUE gifft en Tall för den Dag torüch, d.h., de Tall vun "
"Daag siet 31. Dezember 1899."

#: functions/datetime.xml:76
msgid "DATEVALUE(date)"
msgstr "DATEVALUE(Datum)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:77
msgid "DATEVALUE(\"2/22/2002\") returns 37309"
msgstr "DATEVALUE(\"2/22/2002\") gifft \"37309\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:90 functions/datetime.xml:111
msgid "Months"
msgstr "Maanden"

#: functions/datetime.xml:94
msgid ""
"The EDATE functions returns the date that is specified by a given date and a "
"number of months before or after that date."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon EDATE gifft dat Datum torüch, dat dör en angeven Datum un en "
"Tall vun Maanden ehr oder na 't Datum fastleggt warrt."

#: functions/datetime.xml:95
msgid "EDATE(date; months)"
msgstr "EDATE(Datum; Maanden)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:96
msgid "EDATE(\"2/22/2002\"; 3) returns \"5/22/2002\""
msgstr "EDATE(\"2/22/2002\"; 3) gifft \"5/22/2002\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:97
msgid "EDATE(\"3/31/2002\"; -1) returns \"2/28/2002\""
msgstr "EDATE(\"3/31/2002\"; -1) gifft \"2/28/2002\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:115
msgid ""
"The EOMONTH functions returns the last day in the month specified by a date "
"and the number of months from that date."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon EOMONTH gifft den lesten Dag vun en Maand torüch, de dör en "
"angeven Datum un de Tall vun Maanden vun dissen Datum af fastleggt warrt."

#: functions/datetime.xml:116
msgid "EOMONTH(date; months)"
msgstr "EOMONTH(Datum; Maanden)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:117
msgid "EOMONTH(\"2/22/2002\"; 3) returns \"5/31/2002\""
msgstr "EOMONTH(\"2/22/2002\"; 3) gifft \"5/31/2002\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:118
msgid "EOMONTH(\"3/12/2002\"; -1) returns \"2/28/2002\""
msgstr "EOMONTH(\"3/12/2002\"; -1) gifft \"2/28/2002\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:119
msgid "EOMONTH(\"3/12/2002\"; 0) returns \"3/31/2002\""
msgstr "EOMONTH(\"3/12/2002\"; 0) gifft \"3/31/2002\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:133
msgid ""
"The YEAR functions returns the year of a date. If no parameter is specified "
"the current year gets returned."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon YEAR gifft dat Johr vun en Datum torüch. Wenn keen Parameter "
"fastleggt is, warrt dat aktuell Johr torüchgeven."

#: functions/datetime.xml:134
msgid "YEAR(date)"
msgstr "YEAR(Datum)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:135
msgid "YEAR(\"2/22/2002\") returns 2002"
msgstr "YEAR(\"2/22/2002\") gifft \"2002\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:136
msgid "YEAR(2323.1285) returns 1906"
msgstr "YEAR(2323.1285) gifft \"1906\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:150
msgid ""
"The MONTH functions returns the month of a date. If no parameter is "
"specified the current month gets returned."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon MONTH gifft den Maand vun en Datum torüch. Wenn keen Parameter "
"fastleggt is, warrt de aktuell Maand torüchgeven."

#: functions/datetime.xml:151
msgid "MONTH(date)"
msgstr "MONTH(Datum)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:152
msgid "MONTH(\"2/22/2002\") returns 2"
msgstr "MONTH(\"2/22/2002\") gifft \"2\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:153
msgid "MONTH(2323.1285) returns 5"
msgstr "MONTH(2323.1285) gifft \"5\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:167
msgid ""
"The DAY functions returns the day of a date. If no parameter is specified "
"the current day gets returned."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon DAY gifft den Dag vun en Datum torüch. Wenn keen Parameter "
"fastleggt is, warrt de aktuell Dag torüchgeven."

#: functions/datetime.xml:168
msgid "DAY(date)"
msgstr "DAY(Datum)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:169
msgid "DAY(\"2/22/2002\") returns 22"
msgstr "DAY(\"2/22/2002\") gifft \"22\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:170
msgid "DAY(2323.1285) returns 11"
msgstr "DAY(2323.1285) gifft \"11\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:184
msgid ""
"The HOUR functions returns the hour of a time. If no parameter is specified "
"the current hour gets returned."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon HOUR gifft de Stunn vun en Tietangaav torüch. Wenn keen "
"Parameter fastleggt is, warrt de aktuell Stunn torüchgeven."

#: functions/datetime.xml:185
msgid "HOUR(time)"
msgstr "HOUR(Tiet)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:186
msgid "HOUR(\"22:10:12\") returns 22"
msgstr "HOUR(\"22:10:12\") gifft \" 22\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:187
msgid "HOUR(0.1285) returns 3"
msgstr "HOUR(0.1285) gifft \"3\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:201
msgid ""
"The MINUTE functions returns the minutes of a time. If no parameter is "
"specified the current minute is returned."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon MINUTE gifft de Minuten vun en Tietangaav torüch. Wenn keen "
"Parameter fastleggt is, warrt de aktuell Minuut torüchgeven."

#: functions/datetime.xml:202
msgid "MINUTE(time)"
msgstr "MINUTE(Tiet)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:203
msgid "MINUTE(\"22:10:12\") returns 10"
msgstr "MINUTE(\"22:10:12\") gifft \" 10\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:204
msgid "MINUTE(0.1234) returns 57"
msgstr "MINUTE(0.1234) gifft \"57\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:218
msgid ""
"The SECOND functions returns the seconds of a time. If no parameter is "
"specified the current second is returned."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SECOND gifft de Sekunnen vun en Tietangaav torüch. Wenn keen "
"Parameter fastleggt is, warrt de aktuell Sekunn torüchgeven."

#: functions/datetime.xml:219
msgid "SECOND(time)"
msgstr "SECOND(Tiet)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:220
msgid "SECOND(\"22:10:12\") returns 12"
msgstr "SECOND(\"22:10:12\") gifft \"12\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:221
msgid "SECOND(0.1234) returns 42"
msgstr "SECOND(0.1234) gifft \"42\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:231 functions/datetime.xml:254
#: functions/datetime.xml:277 functions/datetime.xml:300
msgid "First (earlier) date value"
msgstr "Eerst (fröher) Weert vun't Datum"

#: functions/datetime.xml:235 functions/datetime.xml:258
#: functions/datetime.xml:281 functions/datetime.xml:304
msgid "Second date value"
msgstr "Tweet Weert vun't Datum"

#: functions/datetime.xml:239 functions/datetime.xml:262
#: functions/datetime.xml:285
msgid "Calculation mode"
msgstr "Utrekenmetood"

#: functions/datetime.xml:243
msgid ""
"The WEEKS() function returns the difference between two dates in weeks.The "
"third parameter indicates the calculation mode: if the mode is 0, WEEKS() "
"returns the maximal possible number of weeks between those days. If the mode "
"is 1, it only returns the number of whole weeks in between."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon WEEKS() gifft den Verscheel twischen twee Daag in Weken "
"torüch. De drüdde Parameter gifft de Rekenmetood an: Metood 0 gifft de "
"tohööchst mööglich Tall vun Weken twischen twee Daag torüch. Metood 1 gifft "
"bloots de Tall vun heel Weken torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:244
msgid "WEEKS(date2; date1; mode)"
msgstr "WEEKS(Datum1; Datum2; Metood)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:245
msgid ""
"WEEKS(\"2002-02-18\"; \"2002-02-26\"; 0) returns 1, because there is one "
"week and 1 day in between"
msgstr ""
"WEEKS(\"18.02.2002\"; \"26.02.2002\"; 0) gifft \"1\" torüch, wiel dor een "
"Week un een Dag twischen liggt."

#: functions/datetime.xml:246
msgid ""
"WEEKS(\"2002-19-02\"; \"2002-19-02\"; 1) returns 0, because there is not a "
"whole week in between, starting at the first day of the week (monday or "
"sunday, depending on your local settings)"
msgstr ""
"WEEKS(\"19.02.2002\"; \"26.02.2002\"; 0) gifft \"0\" torüch, wiel dor keen "
"heel Week twischen liggt, wenn Een an'n eersten Dag vun de Week (Maandag "
"oder Sünndag, afhängig vun de Regiooninstellen) anfangt."

#: functions/datetime.xml:266
msgid ""
"The MONTHS() function returns the difference between two dates in months.The "
"third parameter indicates the calculation mode: if the mode is 0, MONTHS() "
"returns the maximal possible number of months between those days. If the "
"mode is 1, it only returns the number of complete months in between."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon MONTHS() gifft den Verscheel twischen twee Daag in Maanden "
"torüch. De drüdde Parameter gifft de Rekenmetood an: Metood 0 gifft de "
"tohööchst mööglich Tall vun Maanden twischen twee Daag torüch. Metood 1 "
"gifft bloots de Tall vun heel Maanden torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:267
msgid "MONTHS(date2; date1; mode)"
msgstr "MONTHS(Datum1; Datum2; Metood)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:268
msgid ""
"MONTHS(\"2002-01-18\"; \"2002-02-26\"; 0) returns 1, because there is 1 "
"month and 8 days in between"
msgstr ""
"MONTHS(\"18.01.2002\"; \"26.02.2002\"; 0) gifft \"1\" torüch, wiel dor een "
"Maand un 8 Daag twischen liggt"

#: functions/datetime.xml:269
msgid ""
"MONTHS(\"2002-01-19\"; \"2002-02-26\"; 1) returns 0, because there is not a "
"whole month in between, starting at the first day of the month"
msgstr ""
"MONTHS(\"18.01.2002\"; \"26.02.2002\"; 1) gifft \"0\" torüch, wiel dor keen "
"heel Kalennermaand twischen liggt"

#: functions/datetime.xml:289
msgid ""
"The YEARS() function returns the difference between two dates in years. The "
"third parameter indicates the calculation mode: if the mode is 0, YEARS() "
"returns the maximal possible number of years between those days. If the mode "
"is 1, it only returns whole years, starting at the 1st Jan and ending on the "
"31st Dec."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon YEARS() gifft den Verscheel twischen twee Daag in Johren "
"torüch.De drüdde Parameter gifft de Rekenmetood an: Metood 0 gifft de "
"tohööchst mööglich Tall vun Johren twischen twee Daag torüch. Metood 1 gifft "
"bloots de Tall vun heel Johren torüch, anfungen an'n 1. Januor un ennen an'n "
"31.Dezember."

#: functions/datetime.xml:290
msgid "YEARS(date2; date1; mode)"
msgstr "YEARS(Datum1; Datum2; Metood)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:291
msgid ""
"YEARS(\"2001-02-19\"; \"2002-02-26\"; 0) returns 1, because there is one "
"year and 7 days in between"
msgstr ""
"YEARS(\"19.02.2002\"; \"26.02.2002\"; 0) gifft\"1\" torüch, wiel dor een "
"Johr un söven Daag twischen liggt"

#: functions/datetime.xml:292
msgid ""
"YEARS(\"2002-02-19\"; \"2002-02-26\"; 1) returns 0, because there is not a "
"whole year in between, starting at the first day of the year"
msgstr ""
"YEARS(\"19.02.2002\"; \"26.02.2002\"; 1) gifft \"0\" torüch, wiel dor keen "
"heel Kalennerjohr twischen liggt"

#: functions/datetime.xml:308
msgid "The DAYS() function returns the difference between two dates in days."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon DAYS() gifft den Verscheel twischen twee Daten in Daag torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:309
msgid "DAYS(date2; date1)"
msgstr "DAYS(Datum1; Datum2)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:310
msgid "DAYS(\"2002-02-22\"; \"2002-02-26\") returns 4"
msgstr "DAYS(\"22.02.2002\"; \"26.02.2002\") gifft \"4\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:318 functions/datetime.xml:341
#: functions/datetime.xml:401 functions/datetime.xml:415
#: functions/datetime.xml:433 functions/datetime.xml:447
#: functions/datetime.xml:574
msgid "Year"
msgstr "Johr"

#: functions/datetime.xml:322 functions/datetime.xml:345
#: functions/datetime.xml:419 functions/financial.xml:301
msgid "Month"
msgstr "Maand"

#: functions/datetime.xml:326 functions/datetime.xml:349
msgid "Day"
msgstr "Dag"

#: functions/datetime.xml:330
msgid ""
"The DAYOFYEAR() function returns the number of the day in the year (1...365)."
msgstr "De Funkschoon DAYOFYEAR() giff de Daagnummer in't Johr an (1 - 365)."

#: functions/datetime.xml:331
msgid "DAYOFYEAR(year;month;date)"
msgstr "DAYOFYEAR(Johr;Maand;Dag)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:332
msgid "DAYOFYEAR(2000;12;1) returns 336"
msgstr "DAYOFYEAR(2000;12;1) gifft \"336\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:333
msgid "DAYOFYEAR(2000;2;29) returns 60"
msgstr "DAYOFYEAR(2000;2;29) gifft \"60\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:353
msgid "The DATE() function returns the date formatted with local parameters."
msgstr "De Funkschoon DATE() gifft dat Datum in't lokaal Schrievformaat ut."

#: functions/datetime.xml:354
msgid "DATE(year;month;date)"
msgstr "DATE(Johr;Maand;Dag)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:355
msgid "DATE(2000;5;5) returns Friday 05 May 2000"
msgstr "DATE(2000;5;5) gifft \"Freedag 5. Mai 2000\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:375
msgid "The TIME() function returns the time formatted with local parameters."
msgstr "De Funkschoon TIME() gifft de Tiet in't lokaal Schrievformaat ut."

#: functions/datetime.xml:376
msgid "TIME(hours;minutes;seconds)"
msgstr "TIME(Stünnen;Minuten;Sekunnen)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:377
msgid "TIME(10;2;2) returns 10:02:02"
msgstr "TIME(10;2;2) gifft \"10:02:02\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:378
msgid "TIME(10;70;0) returns 11:10:0"
msgstr "TIME(10;70;0) gifft \"11:10:00\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:379
msgid "TIME(10;-40;0) returns 9:20:0"
msgstr "TIME(10;-40;0) gifft \"9:20:00\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:391
msgid ""
"The HOURS() function returns the value of the hours in a time expression."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon HOURS() gifft de Tall vun Stünnen binnen en Tietingaav ut."

#: functions/datetime.xml:392
msgid "HOURS(time)"
msgstr "HOURS(Tiet)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:393
msgid "HOURS(\"10:5:2\") returns 10"
msgstr "HOURS(\"10:5:2\") gifft \"10\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:405
msgid "The function ISLEAPYEAR() returns True if the given year is leap."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ISLEAPYEAR() gifft \"wohr\" torüch, wenn dat angeven Johr en "
"Schaltjohr is."

#: functions/datetime.xml:406
msgid "ISLEAPYEAR(year)"
msgstr "ISLEAPYEAR(Johr)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:407
msgid "ISLEAPYEAR(2000) returns True"
msgstr "ISLEAPYEAR(2000) gifft \"wohr\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:423
msgid ""
"The function DAYSINMONTH() returns the number of days in the given year and "
"month."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon DAYSINMONTH() gifft de Tall vun Daag binnen en angeven Johr un "
"Maand torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:424
msgid "DAYSINMONTH(year;month)"
msgstr "DAYSINMONTH(Johr;Maand)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:425
msgid "DAYSINMONTH(2000;2) returns 29"
msgstr "DAYSINMONTH(2000;2) gifft \"29\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:437
msgid "The function DAYSINYEAR() returns the number of days in the given year."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon DAYSINYEAR() gifft de Tall vun Daag binnen dat angeven Johr "
"torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:438
msgid "DAYSINYEAR(year)"
msgstr "DAYSINYEAR(Johr)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:439
msgid "DAYSINYEAR(2000) returns 366"
msgstr "DAYSINYEAR(2000) gifft \"366\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:451
msgid ""
"The function WEEKSINYEAR() returns the number of weeks in the given year."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon WEEKSINYEAR() gifft de Tall vun Weken binnen dat angeven Johr "
"torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:452
msgid "WEEKSINYEAR(year)"
msgstr "WEEKSINYEAR(Johr)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:453
msgid "WEEKSINYEAR(2000) returns 52"
msgstr "WEEKSINYEAR(2000) gifft \"52\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:465
msgid ""
"The MINUTES() function returns the value of the minutes in a time expression."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon MINUTES() gifft de Tall vun Minuten binnen en Tietutdruck "
"torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:466
msgid "MINUTES(time)"
msgstr "MINUTES(Tiet)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:467
msgid "MINUTES(\"10:5:2\") returns 5"
msgstr "MINUTES(\"10:5:2\") gifft \"5\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:479
msgid ""
"The SECONDS() function returns the value of the seconds in a time expression."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon SECONDS() gifft de Tall vun Sekunnen binnen en Tietutdruck "
"torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:480
msgid "SECONDS(time)"
msgstr "SECONDS(Tiet)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:481
msgid "SECONDS(\"10:5:2\") returns 2"
msgstr "SECONDS(\"10:5:2\") gifft \"2\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:489
msgid "Number of day in week (1..7)"
msgstr "Nummer vun den Wekendag (1..7)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:493
msgid ""
"The DAYNAME() function returns the name of the day of the week (1..7). In "
"some countries the first day of the week is Monday, while in others the "
"first day of the week is Sunday."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon DAYNAME() gifft den Naam vun en Wekendag (1-7) torüch. In en "
"poor Länner is de eerste Wekendag en Maandag, anners Sünndag."

#: functions/datetime.xml:494
msgid "DAYNAME(weekday)"
msgstr "DAYNAME(Wekendag)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:495
msgid "DAYNAME(1) returns Monday (if the week starts on Monday)"
msgstr ""
"DAYNAME(1) gifft \"Maandag\"\" torüch (wenn de Week mit en Maandag anfangt)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:504
msgid "Number of month (1..12)"
msgstr "Den Maand sien Nummer (1..12)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:508
msgid "The MONTHNAME() function returns the name of the month (1...12)."
msgstr "De Funkschoon MONTHNAME() gifft den Maand sien Naam torüch (1..12)."

#: functions/datetime.xml:509
msgid "MONTHNAME(number)"
msgstr "MONTHNAME(Tall)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:510
msgid "MONTHNAME(5) returns May"
msgstr "MONTHNAME(5) gifft \"Mai\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:518
msgid ""
"The CURRENTDATE() function returns the current date. It is equivalent to the "
"TODAY function."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CURRENTDATE() gifft dat aktuelle Datum in't lokaal "
"Schrievformaat torüch. Dat is dat Sülve as de Funkschoon TODAY."

#: functions/datetime.xml:519
msgid "CURRENTDATE()"
msgstr "CURRENTDATE()"

#: functions/datetime.xml:520
msgid "CURRENTDATE() returns \"Saturday 13 April 2002\""
msgstr ""
"CURRENTDATE() gifft dat aktuelle Datum in de Form \"Saturday 13 April 2002\" "
"torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:530
msgid "The TODAY() function returns the current date."
msgstr "De Funkschoon TODAY() gifft dat aktuelle Datum torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:531
msgid "TODAY()"
msgstr "TODAY()"

#: functions/datetime.xml:532
msgid "TODAY() returns \"Saturday 13 April 2002\""
msgstr ""
"TODAY() gifft dat aktuelle Datum in de Form \"Saturday 13 April 2002\" "
"torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:542
msgid ""
"The NOW() function returns the current date and time. It is identical with "
"CURRENTDATETIME and provided for compatibility with other applications."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon NOW() gifft dat aktuelle Datum un de Klock in't lokaal "
"Schrievformaat torüch. Dat is dat sülve as de Funkschoon CURRENTDATETIME un "
"warrt ut Kompatibiliteetgrünn mit anner Programmen praatstellt."

#: functions/datetime.xml:543
msgid "NOW()"
msgstr "NOW()"

#: functions/datetime.xml:544
msgid "NOW() returns \"Saturday 13 April 2002 19:12:01\""
msgstr "NOW() gifft a.B. \"Saturday 13 April 2002 19:12:01\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:554
msgid "The CURRENTDATETIME() function returns the current date and time."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CURRENTDATETIME() gifft dat aktuelle Datum un de Klock torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:555
msgid "CURRENTDATETIME()"
msgstr "CURRENTDATETIME()"

#: functions/datetime.xml:556
msgid "CURRENTDATETIME() returns \"Saturday 13 April 2002 19:12:01\""
msgstr ""
"CURRENTDATETIME() gifft dat aktuelle Datum in de Form \"Sünnavend 13 April "
"2002\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:564
msgid ""
"The CURRENTTIME() function returns the current time formatted with local "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CURRENTTIME() gifft de aktuelle Tiet in't lokaal Tietformaat "
"torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:565
msgid "CURRENTTIME()"
msgstr "CURRENTTIME()"

#: functions/datetime.xml:566
msgid "CURRENTTIME() returns \"19:12:01\""
msgstr "CURRENTTIME() gifft de aktuelle Tiet in de Form \"19:12:01\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:578
msgid ""
"The EASTERSUNDAY() function returns the date which corresponds to Easter "
"Sunday in the year given as the parameter."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon EASTERSUNDAY() gifft dat tohören Datum vun'n Oostersünndag "
"vun't ingeven Johr torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:579
msgid "EASTERSUNDAY(year)"
msgstr "EASTERSUNDAY(Johr)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:580
msgid "EASTERSUNDAY(2003) returns \"20th April 2003\""
msgstr "EASTERSUNDAY(2003) gifft \"20th April 2003\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:592
msgid ""
"The ISOWEEKNUM() function returns number of the week which the date falls "
"into. Note that this function is compliant with the ISO8601 standard: a week "
"always begins on a Monday, and ends on a Sunday. The first week of a year is "
"that week which contains the first Thursday of the year."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon ISOWEEKNUM() gifft de Weeknummer vun en Datum torüch. Beacht, "
"dat disse Funkschoon den Standard \"ISO8601\" topasst is: En Week fangt "
"jümmers mit en Maandag an un endt mit enn Sünndag. De eerste Week vun en "
"Johr is de Week mit den eersten Dunnersdag in't Johr."

#: functions/datetime.xml:593
msgid "ISOWEEKNUM(date)"
msgstr "ISOWEEKNUM(Datum)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:594
msgid "ISOWEEKNUM(A1) returns 51 when A1 is \"21st of Dec\"."
msgstr "ISOWEEKNUM(A1) gifft \"51\" torüch, wenn A1 \"21st of Dec\" is."

#: functions/datetime.xml:611
msgid ""
"The WEEKNUM() function returns the non-ISO week number in which the date "
"falls into."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon WEEKNUM() gifft de \"nich-ISO\"-Weeknummer torüch, in de dat "
"Datum liggt."

#: functions/datetime.xml:612
msgid "WEEKNUM(date; method)"
msgstr "WEEKNUM(Datum; Utrekenmetood)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:613
msgid ""
"WEEKNUM(A1; 1) returns 11 when A1 is \"9th of March 2008\". Number of the "
"week in the year, with a week beginning on Sunday (1, this is the default if "
"Method is omitted.)"
msgstr ""
"WEEKNUM(A1; 1) gifft 11 torüch, wenn A1 de »9. März 2008« is. De Wekennummer "
"in't Johr, wenn de Week op Sünndag anfangt (1, de Standardinstellen wenn "
"utlaten)."

#: functions/datetime.xml:614
msgid ""
"WEEKNUM(A1; 2) returns 10 when A1 is \"9th of March 2008\". Number of the "
"week in the year, with a week beginning on Monday (2)"
msgstr ""
"WEEKNUM(A1; 2) gifft 10 torüch, wenn A1 de »9. März 2008« is. De Wekennummer "
"in't Johr, wenn de Week op Maandag anfangt (2)."

#: functions/datetime.xml:623 functions/datetime.xml:647
msgid "First date"
msgstr "Eerst Datum"

#: functions/datetime.xml:627 functions/datetime.xml:651
msgid "Second date"
msgstr "Tweet Datum"

#: functions/datetime.xml:631 functions/datetime.xml:655
msgid "interval"
msgstr "Twischentiet"

#: functions/datetime.xml:635
msgid "The DATEDIF() function returns the difference between two dates."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon DATEDIF() gifft den Verscheel twischen twee Daten torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:636
msgid ""
"Interval must be one of the following: \"m\": month; \"d\": days; \"y\": "
"complete years; \"ym\": month excluding years; \"yd\": days excluding years; "
"\"md\": days excluding months and years"
msgstr ""
"Twischentiet mutt een vun de nakamen wesen: \"m\": Maand; \"d\": Daag; \"y"
"\": heel Johren; \"ym\": Maand ahn Johren; \"yd\": Daag ahn Johren; \"md\": "
"Daag ahn Maanden un ok ahn Johren"

#: functions/datetime.xml:637
msgid "DATEDIF(first date; second date; interval)"
msgstr "DATEDIF(Eerst Datum, tweet Datum, Twischentiet)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:638
msgid ""
"DATEDIF(A1;A2;\"d\") A1 is \"1st of January 1995\" and A2 is \"15th of June "
"1999\" returns number of days 1626"
msgstr ""
"DATEDIF(A1;A2;\"d\") A1 is \"1st of January 1995\" un A2 is \"15th of June "
"1999\" gifft de Tall vun Daag torüch: 1626"

#: functions/datetime.xml:639
msgid ""
"DATEDIF(A1;A2;\"m\") A1 is \"1st of January 1995\" and A2 is \"15th of June "
"1999\" returns number of months 53"
msgstr ""
"DATEDIF(A1;A2;\"m\") Wenn A1 de »1. Januor 1995« un A2 de »15. Juni 1999« "
"is, gifft de Tall vun Maanden torüch: 53"

#: functions/datetime.xml:659
msgid ""
"The YEARFRAC() function returns the number of full days between start date "
"and end date according to the basis."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon YEARFRAC() gifft de Tall vun heel Daag twischen Start- un "
"Enndatum torüch, afhängig vun de Basis."

#: functions/datetime.xml:660
msgid ""
"Basis must be one of the following: 0 = 30/360 US, 1 = Actual/actual, 2 = "
"Actual/360, 3 = Actual/365, 4 = European 30/360"
msgstr ""
"Basis mutt een vun de nakamen wesen: 0 = 30/360 US, 1 = Redig/redig, 2 = "
"Redig/360, 3 = Redig/365, 4 = Europääsch 30/360"

#: functions/datetime.xml:661
msgid "YEARFRAC(start date; end date; basis)"
msgstr "YEARFRAC(Startdatum, Enndatum, Basis)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:669 functions/datetime.xml:692
msgid "Start date"
msgstr "Startdatum"

#: functions/datetime.xml:673
msgid "Working days"
msgstr "Arbeitdaag"

#: functions/datetime.xml:677 functions/datetime.xml:700
msgid "Holidays"
msgstr "Oorlööf"

#: functions/datetime.xml:681
msgid ""
"The WORKDAY() function returns the date which is working days from the start "
"date."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon WORKDAY() gifft de Daten vun Arbeitdaag af Startdatum ut."

#: functions/datetime.xml:682 functions/datetime.xml:705
msgid ""
"Holidays must be one of the following: number = days to add, a single date "
"or an array of dates."
msgstr ""
"Oorlööf mutt een vun de Nakamen wesen: Tall = Daag för't Tofögen, en "
"Enkeldatum oder en Datenfeld."

#: functions/datetime.xml:683
msgid "WORKDAY(start date; days; holidays)"
msgstr "WORKDAY(Startdatum, Daag, Oorlööf)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:684
msgid ""
"if B9 is \"01/01/2001\", D3 is \"01/03/2001\", D4 is \"01/04/2001\" then "
"WORKDAY(B9;2;D3:D4) returns \"Fri Jan 5 2001\""
msgstr ""
"wenn B9 \"01/01/2001\", D3 \"01/03/2001\", un D4 \"01/04/2001\", denn gifft "
"WORKDAY(B9;2;D3:D4) \"Fri Jan 5 2001\" torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:696
msgid "End date"
msgstr "Enndatum"

#: functions/datetime.xml:704
msgid ""
"The NETWORKDAY() function returns the number of working days between "
"startdate and enddate."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon NETWORKDAY() gifft de Tall vun Arbeitdaag twischen Start- un "
"Enndatum torüch."

#: functions/datetime.xml:706
msgid "NETWORKDAY(start date; end date; holidays)"
msgstr "NETWORKDAY(Startdatum, Enndatum, Oorlööf)"

#: functions/datetime.xml:707
msgid "NETWORKDAY(\"01/01/2001\";\"01/08/2001\") returns 5 workdays"
msgstr "NETWORKDAY(\"01/01/2001\";\"01/08/2001\") gifft 5 Wekendaag torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:708
msgid "NETWORKDAY(\"01/01/2001\";\"01/08/2001\";2) returns 3 workdays"
msgstr "NETWORKDAY(\"01/01/2001\";\"01/08/2001\";2) gifft 3 Wekendaag torüch"

#: functions/datetime.xml:720
