msgstr "POWER(1.2;3.4) gifft \"1.8572\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:141
msgid "POWER(2;3) equals 8"
msgstr "POWER(2;3) gifft \"8\" torüch"

#: functions/math.xml:158
msgid ""
"The POW(x;y) function returns the value of x raised to the power of y. It's "
"the same as POWER."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon POW(x;y) gifft den Weert vun x hooch y torüch. Dat is dat "
"Sülvige as de Funkschoon \"POWER\"."

#: functions/math.xml:159
msgid "POW(value;value)"
msgstr "POW(Weert;Weert)"

#: functions/math.xml:160
